[[File:Peridean_henge.png|thumb|right|240px|The henge on Peridea]]
A '''henge''' was located in the top of a tower on [[Great Mothers' Fortress|a fortress]] located on the [[extragalactic]] [[planet]] [[Peridea]]. Three [[witch]]es calling themselves the [[Great Mothers]]<ref name="Part 6">{{Ahsoka|Part Six: Far, Far Away}}</ref> used the [[henge]] to communicate with their fellow [[Nightsisters|Nightsister]], [[Morgan Elsbeth]], on the [[the galaxy|New Republic's galaxy]]<ref name="Part 2">{{Ahsoka|Part Two: Toil and Trouble}}</ref> on behalf of the [[Chiss]] [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] who was also stranded on the planet.<ref name="Part 6" /> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{AhsokaSeriesDate}}</ref> after Elsbeth finally arrived on the planet on board the ''[[Eye of Sion]]'' to rescue Thrawn, she landed on the henge with her [[Morgan Elsbeth's forces|allies]], where she was greeted by the Mothers.<ref name="Part 6" />

